    (property "Description" "TI MSPM0G3507-Q1 Arm Cortex-M0+ automotive MCU (AEC-Q100 Grade 1, ISO 26262 ASIL B) with CAN-FD, 28-pin VSSOP (DGS28) -- orderable M0G3507QDGS28RQ1, 7.1 x 3 mm. Evaluation/candidate MCU per docs/security-mcu-comparison.md SS9.8; the project MCU of record is still the NXP S32K144 (symbols/specs/S32K144.json, REFERENCES.md [31]) -- adding this symbol does NOT change any build's MCU selection." (id 4) (at 0 0 0)
